{"type":"message","id":"5655320e","parentId":"7525826c","timestamp":"2026-03-13T19:07:04.542Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n哦，看到已经有几个站点的爬虫脚本了：fujian_kjt_scraper.js、scrape_most.js、scrape-xmtorch.js、xm_hrss_extractor.js、get-xmsia-selectors.js，这些正好对应要求的6个站点对吧？现在需要把它们统一重构，做成一个统一的爬虫框架，而不是每个站点单独的脚本。\n首先我应该先创建一个统一的爬虫结构，先建目录：首先DailyReports目录用来存报告，然后config目录存各个站点的选择器配置，src目录存核心代码。然后先写站点配置文件，把现有的6个站点的选择器都整理进去。\n首先先创建DailyReports目录：\n然后创建config/sites.js配置文件，把6个站点的信息都放进去。\n首先先执行mkdir创建需要的目录。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0lo0i8rhyetq6cib32yahthr","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"mkdir -p /home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/DailyReports /home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/config /home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/src"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773428816808}}
